  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThis film-like recipe emphasizes gentle light blues and soft oranges that evoke mist floating in the air. While contrast and chroma are reduced slightly, overall color tones are preserved for results that are reminiscent of those achieved with 35mm film. The overall tone is light blue, but skin tones are enhanced, making this recipe effective for achieving a completely different look. Brighter images will have a soft, refreshing appearance while darker images will be more subdued, allowing users to change the overall feel of their images with different exposure levels.",
